B.aoz=new A.d0("Home","At the top is You: a chat with yourself, kept on your phone, or in your own Google Drive if you connect it. Below it are your groups, and All files, which lists every file from your groups.",!1,null)
B.aox=new A.d0("Send","Tap Send at the bottom of Home. Pick a file or write a note, pick where it goes, then pick how it opens: One open, Watermarked or Traceable copies.",!1,"Tap Send at the bottom of Home. Pick a file or write a note, pick where it goes, then pick how it opens: One open or Watermarked.")
B.aom=new A.d0("What needs an account","Nothing, to send a note or file that opens once, or to open a link or code. Your own chat and groups need you to sign in with Google.",!1,null)
B.aoC=new A.d0("Everything else","Your picture at the top opens your account. Settings has Activity, notifications and Help.",!1,null)
