B.ao6=new A.d0("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1,null)
B.aoy=new A.d0("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1,null)
B.aoj=new A.d0("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1,null)
