B.bd5=s(["Sending several files to your chat no longer closes the app.","Tap a file to open it. Download saves it to your phone.","Press and hold to pick several: download, copy or delete.","Slow internet: files show a percent and carry on after a drop.","Your chat on a computer waits out a lost signal, then comes back."],t.s)
B.blZ=s(["Nox is redrawn: a rounder head, and eyes that glance around.","See a link being misused? Report this link, under About this link."],t.s)
B.bbM=s(["Is it a scam? Send \u203a Ask Nox reads a message, screenshot or PDF on your phone.","Already paid someone? Step-by-step help, also as a Quick Settings tile: I got scammed.","Long-press the NO SUS icon for your chat or a one-open link. Both are on the share sheet too.","Your chat can stay on this phone. No Google Drive needed."],t.s)
B.bca=s(["Steadier: fewer ways to crash, and a camera photo is kept if your phone closes NO SUS.","Crash reports send only the error type and code line, never your content. Off in Settings."],t.s)
B.bjL=s(["Your laptop chat stays open with your phone locked, also on phones that pause apps.","If your phone paused NO SUS, it says why the laptop closed, and how to fix it."],t.s)
B.bhg=s(["Your username is your own address: name.nosus.foo.","Open your chat on a laptop in 3 steps. It can remember your laptop.","Files move both ways with progress and survive a network drop.","HEIC photos work as your profile photo.","Reply to a one-open note, and see when yours is opened."],t.s)
B.bmo=s(["Links you sent: see if each was opened. Signed in, you\u2019re told when.","Active screens, in Settings: see and end where your account is open.","Downloads survive a network blip, and nothing spins forever.","On an iPhone, signing in on the web no longer gets stuck.","Bigger text, fewer taps, and fairer limits on shared Wi-Fi."],t.s)
B.ben=s(["Open on any screen works both ways, for up to 8 hours, with your phone locked.","Links keep the time you picked: no more 20-minute cut-off.","Uploads keep going if you leave the screen. Your link comes back.","Sign out on all devices, in Settings."],t.s)
B.bcf=s(["A new look: paper by day, lamp light at night.","Share a note or file with a 6-digit code.","Faster: NO SUS now runs on servers in India.","A fresh start: sign in again. Old links and groups stay behind."],t.s)
B.CH=new A.cP(B.brp,[B.bd5,B.blZ,B.bbM,B.bca,B.bjL,B.bhg,B.bmo,B.ben,B.bcf],t.VJ)
